  _dialogueNodes:
  - NodeID: start
    SrcImgSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33014fa1867f6194aa26dda4a8707d7c, type: 3}
    CharName: Kania
    Text: Baru balik, Leanst? Gila, makin malem aja balik kerjanya.
    Choices: []
    NextNodeID: convo_1
  - NodeID: convo_1
    SrcImgSprite: {fileID: -2293023420630586820, guid: 9d1f6dda8cbc8b4489f82bb4f62fea22, type: 3}
    CharName: Kania
    Text: Masih kuat ngerjain revisian apa mau langsung pingsan nih?
    Choices:
    - text: Gas ngerjain dikit lah, biar cepet lulus.
      NextNodeID: convo_revisi
    - text: Mau pingsan aja, udah nggak sanggup liat monitor.
      NextNodeID: convo_pingsan
    NextNodeID: 
  - NodeID: convo_revisi
    SrcImgSprite: {fileID: 2436765836460012559, guid: 9d1f6dda8cbc8b4489f82bb4f62fea22, type: 3}
    CharName: Kania
    Text: Ngeri, emang beneran ambis ya. Yaudah, semangat deh calon sarjana!
    Choices: []
    NextNodeID: end_convo
  - NodeID: convo_pingsan
    SrcImgSprite: {fileID: 3914889051997854691, guid: 9d1f6dda8cbc8b4489f82bb4f62fea22, type: 3}
    CharName: Kania
    Text: Wkwk, yaudah gih. Istirahat yang bener, muka lu udah kayak zombie soalnya.
    Choices: []
    NextNodeID: end_convo
  - NodeID: end_convo
    SrcImgSprite: {fileID: 0}
    CharName: Leanst
    Text: '*(Gue cuma bisa senyum tipis. Jangankan ngerjain revisian, buat buka kunci
      pintu kamar aja rasanya berat banget.)*'
    Choices: []
    NextNodeID: 
  setRead: 0
